From: Viktor Pashaiev <w.paszajew@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:50:45 +0100
Subject: fix(systemd-networkd): order wait-online before nss-lookup.target

Order systemd-networkd-wait-online.service before nss-lookup.target and
pull in nss-lookup.target when rd.neednet=1 is active so services
ordered After=nss-lookup.target (such as chronyd.service) wait for the
network to be online.

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/dracut-ng/dracut/pull/2845
---
 modules.d/11systemd-networkd/99-wait-online-dracut.conf | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules.d/11systemd-networkd/99-wait-online-dracut.conf b/modules.d/11systemd-networkd/99-wait-online-dracut.conf
index da90596..4b40bd8 100644
--- a/modules.d/11systemd-networkd/99-wait-online-dracut.conf
+++ b/modules.d/11systemd-networkd/99-wait-online-dracut.conf
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 [Unit]
-Before=dracut-initqueue.service
+Before=dracut-initqueue.service nss-lookup.target
+Wants=nss-lookup.target
 ConditionPathExists=/run/networkd/initrd/neednet
 
 [Service]
